model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "The pool account recovery scenario defers every queued job of its team and of its own actors before the warm-up cron runs, so it starts no provisioning workflow, and so no workflow follow-up dispatch, before its final cron tick. Each role or email-verification update whose trigger queues a job commits in one held transaction together with that deferral, so no other dispatch ever sees the job ready. The exact queue checks stay exact; no wait is added."
    }
  }
}
